  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 150,
    "line_end": 150,
    "original_text": "- [ ] 自愈/看门狗：增加安全 healthcheck 路径，只在 `desired_state=enabled` 且 runtime stale/进程不存在时清 stale lease 并重启；`desired_state=paused` 或用户手动 stop 后不得自动重启。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 151,
    "line_end": 151,
    "original_text": "- [ ] Export 节流：把 “每处理 1 个文档就全量 export” 改为 dirty counter / dirty interval 策略，例如累计 N 个文档或 M 分钟再 export；保留 scan due、定时 export、优雅停止前 final export。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 152,
    "line_end": 152,
    "original_text": "- [ ] 批量策略：在 export 节流落地并验证后，再小步提高 `normalize_batch_size` 到 3-5；`llm_summary_batch_size` 先保守保持 1，待 JSON 修复和 source-only prompt 稳定后再评估。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 153,
    "line_end": 153,
    "original_text": "- [ ] LLM 失败降噪：为 JSON 非法增加一次 source-only 安全修复重试；对 forbidden investment conclusion 保持拒绝，但达到阈值后进入冷却或人工审查队列，不在短时间内反复消耗 worker cycle。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 154,
    "line_end": 154,
    "original_text": "- [ ] Scan 优化：先记录 scan duration、files_seen、files_reused、files_hashed，再评估 root mtime 快照/manifest short-circuit，避免未变化根目录重复全量 walk。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 155,
    "line_end": 155,
    "original_text": "- [ ] Blocked 文档清理：建立 67 个 blocked/incomplete/quarantined 文档的 source_id/locator 专项检查清单，按 source identity、manifest、空文件 quarantine 分类修复，不把它们混同为 worker hang。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 156,
    "line_end": 156,
    "original_text": "- [ ] UI 审查：控制面板必须同时显示 live/stale、last heartbeat age、current stage、next wake、pending/blocked/failed 分解；所有状态文案必须来自 `worker-status` 的当前语义，不能直接信 stale runtime。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
