    "line_start": 162,
    "line_end": 162,
    "original_text": "- [ ] Checkpoint D: 自愈验证：enabled + stale 时只启动一个 worker；paused/manual stop 时不重启；重复运行不会产生双 worker。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
