    "original_text": "- [ ] Checkpoint E: Export 节流验证：单文档成功或 document-scoped failure 不再每轮触发全量 export；达到 dirty threshold 或时间阈值才 export。",
    "file_sha256": "bc73a980ac565a603bd7d2d8f95aafd54e4db5c34c9551b0c7219bafee9bbf76"
