  },
  {
    "source_file": "C:\\Users\\郑曾波\\Projects\\company-wiki\\.recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-before-cw-merge-20260725-115819.md",
    "line_start": 179,
    "line_end": 179,
    "original_text": "- [ ] 所有 Source Catalog 改动必须保留上游职责边界：SourceRecord、manifest、EvidenceSpan、extraction quality、source-oriented export；不得新增研究型 writer。",
