    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-current-20260725-114504.md",
    "line_start": 156,
    "line_end": 156,
    "original_text": "- [ ] UI 审查：控制面板必须同时显示 live/stale、last heartbeat age、current stage、next wake、pending/blocked/failed 分解；所有状态文案必须来自 `worker-status` 的当前语义，不能直接信 stale runtime。",
