    "relative": ".recover-task_plan-current-20260725-114504.md",
    "line_start": 179,
    "line_end": 179,
    "original_text": "- [ ] 所有 Source Catalog 改动必须保留上游职责边界：SourceRecord、manifest、EvidenceSpan、extraction quality、source-oriented export；不得新增研究型 writer。",
