    "line_start": 50,
    "line_end": 50,
    "original_text": "- [ ] 发布 `source_manifest` schema：稳定 `source_id`、entity ID、original path、SHA-256、source type、published date、retrieved_at、collector/version、mime/size 和 immutable 状态。",
    "file_sha256": "962a8d0a78b1fafdb2b6a529a21a03da5daf49c7725433bf8cb8126adafe168d"
